{"event": "turn", "session_id": "55ff2c897e8445de85a8be825f801698", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T06:22:17.590922+00:00", "message": "请比较约旦和沙特的待客饮茶习俗。", "resolved_question": "请比较约旦和沙特的待客饮茶习俗。", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 20.798, "model_calls": 2, "input_tokens": 6380, "output_tokens": 894, "response": {"answer": "根据本次检索到的资料，约旦和沙特的待客饮茶习俗可作如下比较：\n\n**约旦**\n- 茶是日常社会与文化生活的组成部分，常见于家庭拜访和聚会场合（来源：Tea's place in Jordanian popular memory and culture, Petra News Agency，年份未标注）。\n- 常与芳香植物一起冲泡，当地研究者提到的例子包括薄荷、茴香和鼠尾草；城市、乡村和贝都因社区做法有差异，这些风味应视为常见例子，而非单一全国配方（同上）。\n\n**沙特阿拉伯**\n- 待客礼仪中常是先上咖啡、后上茶；若场合包含午餐或晚餐，茶有时在餐后较晚时段供应（来源：Drinks in Saudi Arabia, Saudipedia，年份未标注）。\n- 可加入薄荷、婆婆纳或其他芳香叶子（同上）。\n- 有一种“余烬茶”（ember tea）：在水壶中用余烬煮沸水和糖，再加入粗茶叶，这种风格与户外露营相关（同上）。\n- 上述均为有记载的习俗，并非每个家庭都适用的普遍规则（同上）。\n\n**简要对比**\n- 共同点：两国都把茶用于待客和社交聚会，且都常搭配芳香植物。\n- 差异：沙特资料明确描述了“咖啡在前、茶在后”的待客顺序，以及户外露营式的余烬茶；约旦资料更强调茶在日常家庭拜访和聚会中的普遍性，以及城乡与贝都因社区之间的做法差异。\n\n**说明**\n- 以上仅为文化习俗比较，不涉及具体商品推荐或价格库存。\n- 检索到的资料未标注具体年份；另有 UNESCO 关于土耳其和阿塞拜疆“çay 文化”的资料，以及 FAO 2014 年对约旦红茶消费的预测，均与本次约旦—沙特待客习俗比较无直接关系，故未纳入。\n- 关于两国待客用茶的具体茶叶品类、冲泡比例等更细属性，本次资料未提供，无法验证。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "Drinks in Saudi Arabia, Saudipedia", "url": "https://saudipedia.com/en/drinks-in-saudi-arabia", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea's place in Jordanian popular memory and culture, Petra News Agency", "url": "https://petra.gov.jo/index.php/ar/news/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%8A%D9%88%D9%85-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%8A-%D9%84%D9%84%D8%B4%D8%A7%D9%8A-%D9%85%D8%B4%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%A8-%D9%8A%D8%AE%D8%AA%D8%B2%D9%84-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B0%D8%A7%D9%83%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B4%D8%B9%D8%A8%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D9%88%D9%8A%D8%AD%D8%A7%D9%81%D8%B8-%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%89-%D8%AD%D8%B6%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%87-%D9%81%D9%8A-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AB%D9%82%D8%A7%D9%81%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D8%B1%D8%AF%D9%86%D9%8A%D8%A9", "year": null}, {"title": "Culture of Çay (tea), UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage", "url": "https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/culture-of-cay-tea-a-symbol-of-identity-hospitality-and-social-interaction-01685?RL=01685", "year": null}, {"title": "Medium-term outlook for tea, 2014 FAO projection", "url": "https://www.fao.org/fileadmin/templates/est/meetings/IGGtea21/14-Inf3-CurrentSituation.pdf", "year": 2023}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "请比较约旦和沙特的待客饮茶习俗。", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "rules"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "diagnostics": [], "compliance_blocked": false, "explained_categories": [], "pii_redacted": false}, "retrieval": []}
